{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37987","headline":"出官经硖石县 · 韩偓","name":"出官经硖石县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪宦过东畿，所抵州名濮。\n故里欲清明，临风堪恸哭。\n溪长柳似帷，山暖花如醭。\n逆旅讶簪裾，野老悲陵谷。\n暝鸟影连翩，惊狐尾纛簌。\n尚得佐方州，信是皇恩沐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}